# Cloudflare uploads [assets] directory = "." — the WHOLE project — as public
# static files. Nothing is excluded implicitly, so this is an allowlist: ignore
# everything, then re-admit only what the browser is actually meant to fetch.
#
# A denylist here was one forgotten line away from publishing .env, which holds
# GOOGLE_ADS_CLIENT_SECRET. Do not convert this back to a denylist.
/*

# The single-page app, and nothing else.
!/index.html
